her Suits, she is a skilled kickboxer."}],"full_text":"Ms. Dread is a Suit working for the Organization.\n\nHistory\n\nDread is one of the agents stationed in London, England. [OAL-063]\n\nWhilst fighting Lok Lambert, Dread dealt great damage to his Freelancer through her kickboxing skills. Lok noted she kicked much harder than the other Suits. [OAL-063]\n\nAbilities\n\nLike most Suits, Dread was issued with the standard Organization Titans. Unlike other Suits, she is a skilled kickboxer.","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox character\n| image  = File:Ms_Dread.png\n| group  = [[The Organization]] {{Icon|ORG}}<br>[[Suits]]\n| base   = [[London, England]]\n| gender = Female\n| hair   = Blue\n| eyes   = \n| first  = [[TCG:OAL-063|OAL-063]]\n}}'''Ms. Dread''' is a [[Suit]] working for [[the Organization]].\n\n== History ==\nDread is one of the agents stationed in [[London, England]]. {{source|TCG:OAL-063|OAL-063}}\n\nWhilst fighting [[Lok Lambert]], Dread dealt great damage to his [[Freelancer]] through her kickboxing skills. Lok noted she kicked much harder than the other Suits. {{source|TCG:OAL-063|OAL-063}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nLike most Suits, Dread was issued with the standard Organization [[Titans]]. Unlike other Suits, she is a skilled kickboxer.\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]\n[[Category:TCG characters]]","categories":["Characters","Organization members","Seekers","Suits","TCG characters"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:1990","status":"resolved","target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2050","status":"resolved","target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:10363","status":"resolved","target_title":"London, England","label":"London, England","targ